title Enterprise app on Azure
direction down
colorMode bold

Employees [icon: users]
Customers [icon: user]

Azure subscription [icon: cloud, color: blue] {
  Front door [icon: azure-front-door]
  Identity [color: purple] {
    Entra ID [icon: azure-entra-id]
    Key vault [icon: azure-key-vault]
  }
  App tier [color: lightblue] {
    Customer portal [icon: azure-app-service]
    Internal tools [icon: azure-app-service]
    API management [icon: azure-api-management]
    Order functions [icon: azure-functions]
  }
  Integration [color: teal] {
    Service bus [icon: azure-service-bus]
    Logic apps [icon: azure-logic-apps]
    Event grid [icon: azure-event-grid]
  }
  Data tier [color: indigo] {
    SQL database [icon: azure-sql-database]
    Cosmos DB [icon: azure-cosmos-db]
    Blob storage [icon: azure-blob-storage]
    Synapse [icon: azure-synapse]
  }
  Monitor [icon: azure-monitor]
}
SAP ERP [icon: building]

Customers > Front door > Customer portal
Employees > Front door > Internal tools
Customer portal, Internal tools > API management
API management > Order functions
Customer portal, Internal tools <> Entra ID: SSO
Order functions > SQL database, Cosmos DB
Order functions --> Service bus: orders
Service bus > Logic apps > SAP ERP
Blob storage > Event grid > Order functions
SQL database, Cosmos DB > Synapse
App tier -- Key vault: secrets
Monitor --> App tier, Data tier
